{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T16:55:26+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-29T16:55:26+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"DiaSorin S.p.A.","sector":"Healthcare","industry":"Diagnostics & Research","country":"Italy","city":"Saluggia","website":"https://int.diasorin.com","employees":3260,"summary":"DiaSorin S.p.A. engages in research and development, manufacture, and distribution of immunodiagnostics and molecular diagnostics testing kits in Europe, North America, and internationally. It provides various immunodiagnostic in the areas, including infectious diseases, gastrointestinal diseases, hepatitis and retroviruses, endocrinology, metabolic disorders, tumor markers, and oncology under LIAISON XL and LIAISON XS name. The company also offers Simplexa, a congenital CMV direct kit, which detects cytomegalovirus DNA in saliva swab and urine specimens. In addition, it offers LIAISON PLEX Respiratory Flex Assay and the LIAISON PLEX Yeast Blood Culture Assay. Further, the company offers xMAP technology platform, including in vitro diagnostics. The company was founded in 1968 and is headquartered in Saluggia, Italy.","exchange":"Milan","currency":"EUR","financial_currency":"EUR","summary_fr":"DiaSorin S.p.A. s’engage dans la recherche et le développement, la fabrication et la distribution de kits d’immunodiagnostic et de diagnostic moléculaire en Europe, en Amérique du Nord et à l’international. Il fournit divers immunodiagnostic dans les domaines, y compris les maladies infectieuses, les maladies gastro-intestinales, l'hépatite et les rétrovirus, l'endocrinologie, les troubles métaboliques, les marqueurs tumoraux et l'oncologie sous le nom de LIAISON XL et LIAISON XS. La société propose également Simplexa, un kit direct congénital CMV, qui détecte l'ADN du cytomégalovirus dans les prélèvements de salive et d'urine."},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":3970775808,"shares_o